></ul></div></div></div></div></section><section class="relative py-20 sm:py-28 lg:py-36 overflow-hidden bg-gray-50"><div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute" style="left: 5%; top: 10%; width: 200px; height: 200px; transform: rotate(15deg); opacity: 0.06; mask-image: url(&quot;/assets/X_patroon_1771260543289-Db4pmQup.webp&quot;); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center center; background-color: rgb(139, 92, 246);"></div><div class="absolute" style="left: 80%; top: 20%; width: 160px; height: 160px; transform: rotate(-25deg); opacity: 0.06; mask-image: url(&quot;/assets/X_patroon_1771260543289-Db4pmQup.webp&quot;); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center center; background-color: rgb(139, 92, 246);"></div></div><div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10"><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 0ms;"><div class="text-center mb-10 sm:mb-14"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-purple-600 font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-4 sm:mb-5 bg-purple-100/60 px-4 sm:px-5 py-2 rounded-full"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-message-circle w-4 h-4"><path d="M7.9 20A9 9 0 1 0 4 16.1L2 22Z"></path></svg> FAQ</span><h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-black text-gray-900" style="font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;">Frequently asked questions about event staff</h2></div></div><div class="space-y-3 sm:space-y-4"><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 0ms;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden shadow-sm"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-7 text-left"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">Can you scale up quickly for events?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0"><p class="px-5 sm:px-7 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Yes. Flexible scaling is one of EXTRA's core strengths. Whether you need 5 or 80 staff members: we deliver fast and reliably, even on short notice. Get in touch and we'll discuss what's possible straight away.</p></div></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 60ms;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden shadow-sm"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-7 text-left"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">How many staff can you supply for an event?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0"><p class="px-5 sm:px-7 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">We have a pool of 800+ active staff members. For large events we can supply dozens to 100+ staff depending on availability and roles. We have experience with events ranging from 10 to 300+ guests.</p></div></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 120ms;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden shadow-sm"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-7 text-left"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">Do you have staff with event experience?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0"><p class="px-5 sm:px-7 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Yes. Most of our staff work events regularly and are used to busy environments, fast-paced service and large guest numbers. Event experience is a key factor in how we match staff to bookings.</p></div></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 180ms;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden shadow-sm"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-7 text-left"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">Can you supply bar staff and service staff for events?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0"><p class="px-5 sm:px-7 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Yes. We supply experienced bar staff, service staff, dinner runners and event floor support for events of any scale — from a reception with 50 guests to a gala for 500. Everyone is selected on event experience and attitude.</p></div></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 240ms;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden shadow-sm"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-7 text-left"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">Can you supply hosts and hostesses for events?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0"><p class="px-5 sm:px-7 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Yes. Our hosts and hostesses are presentable, articulate and experienced in guest-facing roles: arrivals, cloakroom, registration and escort. They understand the importance of a strong first impression.</p></div></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 300ms;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden shadow-sm"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-7 text-left"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">How quickly can you deliver event staff?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0"><p class="px-5 sm:px-7 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">In most cases we can deliver suitable event staff within 48 hours. Thanks to our large pool of experienced staff, we can move quickly — including on last-minute requests.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="cta" class="relative py-20 sm:py-28 lg:py-36 overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-950 via-purple-900 to-indigo-950"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none overflow-hidden "><div class="absolute" style="left: 5%; top: 10%; width: 200px; height: 200px; transform: rotate(15deg); opacity: 0.12; mask-image: url(&quot;/assets/X_patroon_1771260543289-Db4pmQup.webp&quot;); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center center; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);"></div><div class="absolute" style="left: 80%; top: 20%; width: 160px; height: 160px; transform: rotate(-25deg); opacity: 0.12; mask-image: url(&quot;/assets/X_patroon_1771260543289-Db4pmQup.webp&quot;); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center center; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);"></div><div class="absolute" style="left: 50%; top: 60%; width: 240px; height: 240px; transform: rotate(35deg); opacity: 0.12; mask-image: url(&quot;/assets/X_patroon_1771260543289-Db4pmQup.webp&quot;); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center center; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);"></div><div class="absolute" style="left: 15%; top: 75%; width: 180px; height: 180px; transform: rotate(-10deg); opacity: 0.12; mask-image: url(&quot;/assets/X_patroon_1771260543289-Db4pmQup.webp&quot;); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center center; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);"></div></div><div class="relative z-10 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center"><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 0ms;"><sp