nded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-purple-500/10 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 h-full shadow-sm"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-500 to-indigo-600 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300 shadow-md"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-bell w-6 h-6 text-white"><path d="M6 8a6 6 0 0 1 12 0c0 7 3 9 3 9H3s3-2 3-9"></path><path d="M10.3 21a1.94 1.94 0 0 0 3.4 0"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-black text-gray-900 mb-2 sm:mb-3">Always call to cancel</h3><p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Staff are required to cancel by phone. A text message or chat is not sufficient.</p></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 80ms;"><div class="group bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-50 to-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-purple-500/10 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 h-full shadow-sm"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-500 to-red-500 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300 shadow-md"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-alert w-6 h-6 text-white"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="8" y2="12"></line><line x1="12" x2="12.01" y1="16" y2="16"></line></svg></div><h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-black text-gray-900 mb-2 sm:mb-3">€50 fine for improper cancellation</h3><p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Anyone who doesn't follow the protocol is fined €50. Immediate, consistent and fair.</p></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 160ms;"><div class="group bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-50 to-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-purple-500/10 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 h-full shadow-sm"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-red-500 to-rose-600 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300 shadow-md"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-lock w-6 h-6 text-white"><rect width="18" height="11" x="3" y="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-black text-gray-900 mb-2 sm:mb-3">2× improper = non-active</h3><p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">After two improper cancellations a staff member is suspended. No second chance for carelessness.</p></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 240ms;"><div class="group bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-50 to-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-purple-500/10 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 h-full shadow-sm"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-green-500 to-emerald-600 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300 shadow-md"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield w-6 h-6 text-white"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-black text-gray-900 mb-2 sm:mb-3">You're never caught off guard</h3><p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Thanks to this protocol you know in good time when someone can't make it — so we can arrange a replacement.</p></div></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 350ms;"><div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-900 via-purple-800 to-indigo-900 rounded-2xl sm:rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-10 text-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check w-10 h-10 text-green-400 mx-auto mb-4"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-white mb-3" style="font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;">Reliability is not an afterthought at EXTRA</h3><p class="text-purple-200/80 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed max-w-xl mx-auto">Our cancellation protocol is not for show. It protects you as a client and ensures our staff take their responsibilities seriously.</p></div></div></div></section><section id="how-it-works" class="relative py-20 sm:py-28 lg:py-36 overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-950 via-purple-900 to-indigo-950"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none overflow-hidden "><div class="absolute" style="left: 5%; top: 10%; width: 200px; height: 200px; transform: rotate(15deg); opacity: 0.12; mask-image: url(&quot;/assets/X_patroon_1771260543289-Db4pmQup.webp&quot;); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center center; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);"></div><div class="absolute" style="left: 80%; top: 20%; width: 160px; height: 160px; transform: rotate(-25deg); opacity: 0.12; mask-image: url(&quot;/assets/X_patroon_1771260543289-Db4pmQup.webp&quot;); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center center; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);"></div><div class="absolute" style="left: 50%; top: 60%; width: 240px; height: 240px; transform: rotate(35deg); opacity: 0.12; mask-image: url(&quot;/assets/X_patroon_1771260543289-Db4pmQup.webp&quot;); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center center; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);"></div><div class="absolute" style="left: 15%; top: 75%; width: 180px; height: 180px; transform: rotate(-10deg); opacity: 0.12; mask-image: url(&quot;/assets/X_patroon_1771260543289-Db4pmQup.webp&quot;); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center center; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);"></div><div class="absolute" style="left: 90%; top: 80%; width: 140px; height: 140px; transform: rotate(45deg); opacity: 0.12; mask-image: url(&quot;/assets/X_patroon_1771260543289-Db4pmQup.webp&quot;); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center center; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);"></div></div><div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10"><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 0ms;"><div class="text-center mb-12 sm:mb-20"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-purple-300 font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-4 sm:mb-5 bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm px-4 sm:px-5 py-2 rounded-full border border-white/10"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-zap w-4 h-4"><path d="M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z"></path></svg> How it works for clients</span><h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-black text-white" style="font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;">How working with EXTRA works</h2><p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-purple-200/70 mt-4 max-w-2xl mx-auto">From first request to a fixed favourites pool. Four steps.</p></div></div><div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 sm:gap-6"><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 0ms;"><div class="group bg-white/[0.06] backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl sm:rounded-[1.5rem] p-6 sm:p-8 border border-white/[0.08] hover:border-purple-400/30 hover:bg-white/[0.10] hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-purple-500/10 transition-all duration-300 h-full text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 sm:w-14 sm:h-14 rounded-xl sm:rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-500 to-purple-700 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 sm:mb-5 mx-auto group-hover:scale-110 transition-all duration-300 shadow-lg"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-phone w-6 h-6 sm:w-7 sm:h-7 text-white"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"></path></svg></div><div class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-black text-purple-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2 sm:mb-3">Step 1</div><h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-black text-white mb-2 sm:mb-3">Tell us what you need</h3><p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-purple-200/70 leading-relaxed">Which roles, when and how many people? We immediately think along on the best approach.</p></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 100ms;"><div class="group bg-white/[0.06] backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl sm:rounded-[1.5rem] p-6 sm:p-8 border border-white/[0.08] hover:border-purple-400/30 hover:bg-white/[0.10] hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-purple-500/10 transition-all duration-300 h-full text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 sm:w-14 sm:h-14 rounded-xl sm:rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-500 to-purple-700 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 sm:mb-5 mx-auto group-hover:scale-110 transition-all duration-300 shadow-lg"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-user-check w-6 h-6 sm:w-7 sm:h-7 text-white"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle><polyline points="16 11 18 13 22 9"></polyline></svg></div><div class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-black text-purple-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2 sm:mb-3">Step 2</div><h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-black text-white mb-2 sm:mb-3">We select the right people</h3><p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-purple-200/70 leading-relaxed">Based on experience, skills, ratings and favourites pool we put together the best team.</p></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 200ms;"><div class="group bg-white/[0.06] backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl sm:rounded-[1.5rem] p-6 sm:p-8 border border-white/[0.08] hover:border-purple-400/30 hover:bg-white/[0.10] hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-purple-500/10 transition-all duration-300 h-full text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 sm:w-14 sm:h-14 rounded-xl sm:rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-500 to-purple-700 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 sm:mb-5 mx-auto group-hover:scale-110 transition-all duration-300 shadow-lg"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-calendar-check w-6 h-6 sm:w-7 sm:h-7 text-white"><path d="M8 2v4"></path><path d="M16 2v4"></path><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="4" rx="2"></rect><path d="M3 10h18"></path><path d="m9 16 2 2 4-4"></path></svg></div><div class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-black text-purple-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2 sm:mb-3">Step 3</div><h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-black text-white mb-2 sm:mb-3">Your team is ready</h3><p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-purple-200/70 leading-relaxed">A tailor-made team, scheduled and ready to start. You don't have to do a thing.</p></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 300ms;"><div class="group bg-white/[0.06] backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl sm:rounded-[1.5rem] p-6 sm:p-8 border border-white/[0.08] hover:border-purple-400/30 hover:bg-white/[0.10] hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-purple-500/10 transition-all duration-300 h-full text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 sm:w-14 sm:h-14 rounded-xl sm:rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-500 to-purple-700 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 sm:mb-5 mx-auto group-hover:scale-110 transition-all duration-300 shadow-lg"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-trending-up w-6 h-6 sm:w-7 sm:h-7 text-white"><polyline points="22 7 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 2 17"></polyline><polyline points="16 7 22 7 22 13"></polyline></svg></div><div class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-black text-purple-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2 sm:mb-3">Step 4</div><h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-black text-white mb-2 sm:mb-3">Evaluate &amp; build the pool</h3><p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-purple-200/70 leading-relaxed">Feedback after every assignment. That's how we jointly build a reliable, fixed favourites pool.</p></div></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 400ms;"><div class="text-center mt-10 sm:mt-14"><a href="/personeelsaanvraag" class="group bg-white text-purple-900 font-bold px-7 sm:px-10 py-4 sm:py-5 rounded-full text-base sm:text-lg hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-white/20 transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 inline-flex items-center gap-2 sm:gap-3">Start a request now<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right w-5 h-5 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></section><section class="relative py-20 sm:py-28 lg:py-36 overflow-hidden bg-gray-50"><div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute" style="left: 5%; top: 10%; width: 200px; height: 200px; transform: rotate(15deg); opacity: 0.06; mask-image: url(&quot;/assets/X_patroon_1771260543289-Db4pmQup.webp&quot;); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center center; background-color: rgb(139, 92, 246);"></div><div class="absolute" style="left: 80%; top: 20%; width: 160px; height: 160px; transform: rotate(-25deg); opacity: 0.06; mask-image: url(&quot;/assets/X_patroon_1771260543289-Db4pmQup.webp&quot;); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center center; background-color: rgb(139, 92, 246);"></div></div><div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10"><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 0ms;"><div class="text-center mb-10 sm:mb-14"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-purple-600 font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-4 sm:mb-5 bg-purple-100/60 px-4 sm:px-5 py-2 rounded-full"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-message-circle w-4 h-4"><path d="M7.9 20A9 9 0 1 0 4 16.1L2 22Z"></path></svg> FAQ</span><h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-black text-gray-900" style="font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;">Frequently asked questions</h2></div></div><div class="space-y-3 sm:space-y-4"><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 0ms;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden shadow-sm"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-7 text-left"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">How quickly can you supply hospitality staff?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0"><p class="px-5 sm:px-7 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">At EXTRA we understand that busy periods often arise unexpectedly. Thanks to our large pool of experienced staff we can usually deploy people quickly. In many cases we can propose suitable candidates within 48 hours for hotels, restaurants, events or catering assignments.</p></div></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 60ms;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden shadow-sm"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-7 text-left"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">For which roles can I hire hospitality staff?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0"><p class="px-5 sm:px-7 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Via EXTRA you can hire staff for various roles in hospitality. Think of waiting staff, bar staff, runners, chefs, front office agents and housekeeping. We always look at which staff members best fit the assignment and venue.</p></div></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 120ms;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden shadow-sm"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-7 text-left"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">What does hospitality staff cost via a staffing agency?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0"><p class="px-5 sm:px-7 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Costs depend on various factors such as role, experience level and duration of the assignment. At EXTRA we work with transparent rates and are happy to think along on a suitable solution for your situation.</p></div></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 180ms;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden shadow-sm"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-7 text-left"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">Why do businesses choose a hospitality staffing agency?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0"><p class="px-5 sm:px-7 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Many businesses choose a hospitality staffing agency because of the flexibility it offers. You can quickly deploy staff during busy periods, events or sick days. In addition, a staffing agency takes care of recruitment, selection and administration.</p></div></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 240ms;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden shadow-sm"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-7 text-left"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">Can you scale up flexibly for busy periods or events?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0"><p class="px-5 sm:px-7 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Yes. Flexibility is one of the key advantages of working with EXTRA. Whether it's a large event, a busy weekend or a temporary spike: we can scale up and down quickly with experienced hospitality staff.</p></div></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 300ms;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden shadow-sm"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-7 text-left"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">What types of businesses does EXTRA supply staff to?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0"><p class="px-5 sm:px-7 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">EXTRA supplies hospitality staff to various businesses in the hospitality sector, such as hotels, event venues, caterers and restaurants. This gives us broad experience with a wide variety of assignments and work environments.</p></div></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 360ms;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden shadow-sm"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-7 text-left"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">How can I request staff from EXTRA?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg