200/70 leading-relaxed">Which roles, when and how many people? We immediately think along on the best approach.</p></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 100ms;"><div class="group bg-white/[0.06] backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl sm:rounded-[1.5rem] p-6 sm:p-8 border border-white/[0.08] hover:border-purple-400/30 hover:bg-white/[0.10] hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-purple-500/10 transition-all duration-300 h-full text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 sm:w-14 sm:h-14 rounded-xl sm:rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-500 to-purple-700 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 sm:mb-5 mx-auto group-hover:scale-110 transition-all duration-300 shadow-lg"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-user-check w-6 h-6 sm:w-7 sm:h-7 text-white"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle><polyline points="16 11 18 13 22 9"></polyline></svg></div><div class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-black text-purple-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2 sm:mb-3">Step 2</div><h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-black text-white mb-2 sm:mb-3">We select the right people</h3><p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-purple-200/70 leading-relaxed">Based on experience, skills, ratings and favourites pool we put together the best team.</p></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 200ms;"><div class="group bg-white/[0.06] backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl sm:rounded-[1.5rem] p-6 sm:p-8 border border-white/[0.08] hover:border-purple-400/30 hover:bg-white/[0.10] hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-purple-500/10 transition-all duration-300 h-full text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 sm:w-14 sm:h-14 rounded-xl sm:rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-500 to-purple-700 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 sm:mb-5 mx-auto group-hover:scale-110 transition-all duration-300 shadow-lg"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-calendar-check w-6 h-6 sm:w-7 sm:h-7 text-white"><path d="M8 2v4"></path><path d="M16 2v4"></path><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="4" rx="2"></rect><path d="M3 10h18"></path><path d="m9 16 2 2 4-4"></path></svg></div><div class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-black text-purple-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2 sm:mb-3">Step 3</div><h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-black text-white mb-2 sm:mb-3">Your team is ready</h3><p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-purple-200/70 leading-relaxed">A tailor-made team, scheduled and ready to start. You don't have to do a thing.</p></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 300ms;"><div class="group bg-white/[0.06] backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl sm:rounded-[1.5rem] p-6 sm:p-8 border border-white/[0.08] hover:border-purple-400/30 hover:bg-white/[0.10] hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-purple-500/10 transition-all duration-300 h-full text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 sm:w-14 sm:h-14 rounded-xl sm:rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-500 to-purple-700 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 sm:mb-5 mx-auto group-hover:scale-110 transition-all duration-300 shadow-lg"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-trending-up w-6 h-6 sm:w-7 sm:h-7 text-white"><polyline points="22 7 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 2 17"></polyline><polyline points="16 7 22 7 22 13"></polyline></svg></div><div class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-black text-purple-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2 sm:mb-3">Step 4</div><h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-black text-white mb-2 sm:mb-3">Evaluate &amp; build the pool</h3><p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-purple-200/70 leading-relaxed">Feedback after every assignment. That's how we jointly build a reliable, fixed favourites pool.</p></div></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 400ms;"><div class="text-center mt-10 sm:mt-14"><a href="/personeelsaanvraag" class="group bg-white text-purple-900 font-bold px-7 sm:px-10 py-4 sm:py-5 rounded-full text-base sm:text-lg hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-white/20 transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 inline-flex items-center gap-2 sm:gap-3">Start a request now<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right w-5 h-5 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></section><section class="relative py-20 sm:py-28 lg:py-36 overflow-hidden bg-gray-50"><div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute" style="left: 5%; top: 10%; width: 200px; height: 200px; transform: rotate(15deg); opacity: 0.06; mask-image: url(&quot;/assets/X_patroon_1771260543289-Db4pmQup.webp&quot;); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center center; background-color: rgb(139, 92, 246);"></div><div class="absolute" style="left: 80%; top: 20%; width: 160px; height: 160px; transform: rotate(-25deg); opacity: 0.06; mask-image: url(&quot;/assets/X_patroon_1771260543289-Db4pmQup.webp&quot;); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center center; background-color: rgb(139, 92, 246);"></div></div><div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10"><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 0ms;"><div class="text-center mb-10 sm:mb-14"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-purple-600 font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-4 sm:mb-5 bg-purple-100/60 px-4 sm:px-5 py-2 rounded-full"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-message-circle w-4 h-4"><path d="M7.9 20A9 9 0 1 0 4 16.1L2 22Z"></path></svg> FAQ</span><h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-black text-gray-900" style="font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;">Frequently asked questions</h2></div></div><div class="space-y-3 sm:space-y-4"><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 0ms;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden shadow-sm"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-7 text-left"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">How quickly can you supply hospitality staff?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0"><p class="px-5 sm:px-7 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">At EXTRA we understand that busy periods often arise unexpectedly. Thanks to our large pool of experienced staff we can usually deploy people quickly. In many cases we can propose suitable candidates within 48 hours for hotels, restaurants, events or catering assignments.</p></div></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 60ms;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden shadow-sm"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-7 text-left"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">For which roles can I hire hospitality staff?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0"><p class="px-5 sm:px-7 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Via EXTRA you can hire staff for various roles in hospitality. Think of waiting staff, bar staff, runners, chefs, front office agents and housekeeping. We always look at which staff members best fit the assignment and venue.</p></div></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 120ms;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden shadow-sm"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-7 text-left"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">What does hospitality staff cost via a staffing agency?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0"><p class="px-5 sm:px-7 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Costs depend on various factors such as role, experience level and duration of the assignment. At EXTRA we work with transparent rates and are happy to think along on a suitable solution for your situation.</p></div></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 180ms;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden shadow-sm"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-7 text-left"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">Why do businesses choose a hospitality staffing agency?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0"><p class="px-5 sm:px-7 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Many businesses choose a hospitality staffing agency because of the flexibility it offers. You can quickly deploy staff during busy periods, events or sick days. In addition, a staffing agency takes care of recruitment, selection and administration.</p></div></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 240ms;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden shadow-sm"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-7 text-left"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">Can you scale up flexibly for busy periods or events?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0"><p class="px-5 sm:px-7 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Yes. Flexibility is one of the key advantages of working with EXTRA. Whether it's a large event, a busy weekend or a temporary spike: we can scale up and down quickly with experienced hospitality staff.</p></div></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 300ms;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden shadow-sm"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-7 text-left"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">What types of businesses does EXTRA supply staff to?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0"><p class="px-5 sm:px-7 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">EXTRA supplies hospitality staff to various businesses in the hospitality sector, such as hotels, event venues, caterers and restaurants. This gives us broad experience with a wide variety of assignments and work environments.</p></div></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 360ms;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden shadow-sm"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-7 text-left"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">How can I request staff from EXTRA?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg