ss="lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div><section class="py-16 sm:py-24 bg-gray-50"><div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8"><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 0ms;"><div class="text-center mb-10 sm:mb-14"><h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-gray-900 leading-tight" style="font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;">Frequently asked questions about hospitality work via EXTRA</h2></div></div><div class="space-y-3 sm:space-y-4"><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 0ms;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden shadow-sm"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-7 text-left"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">Do I need hospitality experience?</span><span class="text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 "><svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg></span></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0"><p class="px-5 sm:px-7 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Not always. For support roles like runner or dishwasher, no experience is required. For service and bar work, some basic experience is a plus, but we mainly look at your attitude and motivation.</p></div></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 60ms;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden shadow-sm"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-7 text-left"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">Can I choose my own shifts?</span><span class="text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 "><svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg></span></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0"><p class="px-5 sm:px-7 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Yes. Through the EXTRA app you can see which shifts are available and pick what fits you. You decide when you work.</p></div></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 120ms;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden shadow-sm"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-7 text-left"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">How does same-day pay via Jixbee work?</span><span class="text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 "><svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg></span></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0"><p class="px-5 sm:px-7 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">After your shift ends, you're paid out via Jixbee. The amount is usually in your account the same day. You don't need to register separately for this.</p></div></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 180ms;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden shadow-sm"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-7 text-left"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">Which venues can I work at?</span><span class="text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 "><svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg></span></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0"><p class="px-5 sm:px-7 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Through EXTRA you work at hotels, restaurants and events in Amsterdam, Utrecht and The Hague. Think Hilton, Marriott, NH Hotels and various event venues.</p></div></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 240ms;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden shadow-sm"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-7 text-left"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">How quickly can I start working?</span><span class="text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 "><svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg></span></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0"><p class="px-5 sm:px-7 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">After your sign-up and a short intake you can start picking up shifts quickly. In most cases you'll be working within a week.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-12 bg-white border-t border-purple-100/60"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8"><p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-400 mb-6 text-center">Related pages</p><div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3"><a href="/en/hospitality-jobs" class="bg-purple-50 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full border border-purple-100 text-sm font-medium text-gray-6