path></svg> Why EXTRA</span><h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-black text-gray-900" style="font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;">Why hotels choose EXTRA</h2><p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-500 mt-4 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Hotel staff requires more than just experience. Hospitality, representativeness and consistency are essential. EXTRA understands that.</p></div></div><div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4 sm:gap-6"><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 0ms;"><div class="group bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-50 to-white rounded-2xl sm:rounded-[1.5rem] p-6 sm:p-8 border border-purple-100 hover:border-purple-300 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-purple-500/10 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 h-full shadow-sm"><div class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:rotate-6 transition-all duration-300">🏨</div><h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-black text-gray-900 mb-2 sm:mb-3">Familiar with hotel standards</h3><p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Our staff know the difference between three and five-star service. They work according to hotel standards, dress codes and guest relations protocols.</p></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 80ms;"><div class="group bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-50 to-white rounded-2xl sm:rounded-[1.5rem] p-6 sm:p-8 border border-purple-100 hover:border-purple-300 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-purple-500/10 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 h-full shadow-sm"><div class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:rotate-6 transition-all duration-300">🤝</div><h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-black text-gray-900 mb-2 sm:mb-3">Fixed faces per hotel</h3><p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Through favourites pools we build a fixed pool for each hotel. Employees who know your procedures and are immediately deployable.</p></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 160ms;"><div class="group bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-50 to-white rounded-2xl sm:rounded-[1.5rem] p-6 sm:p-8 border border-purple-100 hover:border-purple-300 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-purple-500/10 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 h-full shadow-sm"><div class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:rotate-6 transition-all duration-300">⭐</div><h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-black text-gray-900 mb-2 sm:mb-3">Selected for hospitality</h3><p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Representativeness and hospitality are decisive in our selection. Everyone has had a personal interview first.</p></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 240ms;"><div class="group bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-50 to-white rounded-2xl sm:rounded-[1.5rem] p-6 sm:p-8 border border-purple-100 hover:border-purple-300 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-purple-500/10 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 h-full shadow-sm"><div class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:rotate-6 transition-all duration-300">📞</div><h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-black text-gray-900 mb-2 sm:mb-3">Fast response to absences</h3><p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Sickness or last-minute requests? EXTRA is reachable 24 hours a day and can respond quickly.</p></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 320ms;"><div class="group bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-50 to-white rounded-2xl sm:rounded-[1.5rem] p-6 sm:p-8 border border-purple-100 hover:border-purple-300 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-purple-500/10 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 h-full shadow-sm"><div class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:rotate-6 transition-all duration-300">📊</div><h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-black text-gray-900 mb-2 sm:mb-3">Data per employee per hotel</h3><p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">After every shift we measure performance. So we know exactly who performs best at your location.</p></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 400ms;"><div class="group bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-50 to-white rounded-2xl sm:rounded-[1.5rem] p-6 sm:p-8 border border-purple-100 hover:border-purple-300 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-purple-500/10 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 h-full shadow-sm"><div class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:rotate-6 transition-all duration-300">🛡️</div><h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-black text-gray-900 mb-2 sm:mb-3">Fully employed by us</h3><p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">NEN-4400-1 certified and compliant with labour law. No freelance risks for hotels.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-10 sm:py-16 bg-white border-y border-gray-100 relative overflow-hidden"><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 0ms;"><p class="text-center text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-8 sm:mb-12">Trusted by leading hotel chains in Amsterdam</p></div><div class="relative group overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute left-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-16 sm:w-32 bg-gradient-to-r from-white to-transparent z-10"></div><div class="absolute right-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-16 sm:w-32 bg-gradient-to-l from-white to-transparent z-10"></div><div class="flex animate-marquee-hotel-en group-hover:[animation-play-state:paused]"><div class="flex items-center gap-10 sm:gap-16 lg:gap-20 px-5 sm:px-10 flex-shrink-0"><div class="flex-shrink-0 hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300"><img src="/assets/Lo