-sm sm:text-base text-purple-200/70 leading-relaxed">We check previous hotel experience and references before placing anyone at a hotel.</p></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 300ms;"><div class="group bg-white/[0.06] backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl sm:rounded-[1.5rem] p-6 sm:p-8 border border-white/[0.08] hover:border-purple-400/30 hover:bg-white/[0.10] hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-purple-500/10 transition-all duration-300 h-full"><div class="w-12 h-12 sm:w-14 sm:h-14 rounded-xl sm:rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-500 to-purple-700 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 sm:mb-5 group-hover:scale-110 transition-all duration-300 shadow-lg"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-thumbs-up w-6 h-6 sm:w-7 sm:h-7 text-white"><path d="M7 10v12"></path><path d="M15 5.88 14 10h5.83a2 2 0 0 1 1.92 2.56l-2.33 8A2 2 0 0 1 17.5 22H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2.76a2 2 0 0 0 1.79-1.11L12 2a3.13 3.13 0 0 1 3 3.88Z"></path></svg></div><div class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-black text-purple-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2 sm:mb-3">Step 4</div><h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-black text-white mb-2 sm:mb-3">Rating after every hotel shift</h3><p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-purple-200/70 leading-relaxed">After every shift we measure performance and build a pool of proven employees per hotel.</p></div></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 400ms;"><div class="mt-12 sm:mt-16 text-center"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm border border-white/15 text-white px-6 sm:px-8 py-4 sm:py-5 rounded-2xl"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentCo