-sm sm:text-base text-purple-200/70 leading-relaxed">We check previous hotel experience and references before placing anyone at a hotel.</p></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 300ms;"><div class="group bg-white/[0.06] backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl sm:rounded-[1.5rem] p-6 sm:p-8 border border-white/[0.08] hover:border-purple-400/30 hover:bg-white/[0.10] hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-purple-500/10 transition-all duration-300 h-full"><div class="w-12 h-12 sm:w-14 sm:h-14 rounded-xl sm:rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-500 to-purple-700 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 sm:mb-5 group-hover:scale-110 transition-all duration-300 shadow-lg"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-thumbs-up w-6 h-6 sm:w-7 sm:h-7 text-white"><path d="M7 10v12"></path><path d="M15 5.88 14 10h5.83a2 2 0 0 1 1.92 2.56l-2.33 8A2 2 0 0 1 17.5 22H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2.76a2 2 0 0 0 1.79-1.11L12 2a3.13 3.13 0 0 1 3 3.88Z"></path></svg></div><div class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-black text-purple-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2 sm:mb-3">Step 4</div><h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-black text-white mb-2 sm:mb-3">Rating after every hotel shift</h3><p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-purple-200/70 leading-relaxed">After every shift we measure performance and build a pool of proven employees per hotel.</p></div></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 400ms;"><div class="mt-12 sm:mt-16 text-center"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm border border-white/15 text-white px-6 sm:px-8 py-4 sm:py-5 rounded-2xl"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield w-5 h-5 text-purple-300 flex-shrink-0"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path></svg><p class="text-sm sm:text-base font-semibold leading-snug text-left">No one who works at a hotel via EXTRA has skipped a personal interview. <span class="text-purple-300">That is our standard, not the exception.</span></p></div></div></div></div></section><section id="extraatje" class="relative py-20 sm:py-28 lg:py-36 overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-100 via-purple-50 to-indigo-100"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none overflow-hidden "><div class="absolute" style="left: 5%; top: 10%; width: 200px; height: 200px; transform: rotate(15deg); opacity: 0.1; mask-image: url(&quot;/assets/X_patroon_1771260543289-Db4pmQup.webp&quot;); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center center; background-color: rgb(139, 92, 246);"></div><div class="absolute" style="left: 80%; top: 20%; width: 160px; height: 160px; transform: rotate(-25deg); opacity: 0.1; mask-image: url(&quot;/assets/X_patroon_1771260543289-Db4pmQup.webp&quot;); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center center; background-color: rgb(139, 92, 246);"></div><div class="absolute" style="left: 50%; top: 60%; width: 240px; height: 240px; transform: rotate(35deg); opacity: 0.1; mask-image: url(&quot;/assets/X_patroon_1771260543289-Db4pmQup.webp&quot;); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center center; background-color: rgb(139, 92, 246);"></div><div class="absolute" style="left: 15%; top: 75%; width: 180px; height: 180px; transform: rotate(-10deg); opacity: 0.1; mask-image: url(&quot;/assets/X_patroon_1771260543289-Db4pmQup.webp&quot;); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center center; background-color: rgb(139, 92, 246);"></div></div><div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10"><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 0ms;"><div class="text-center mb-12 sm:mb-20"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-purple-600 font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-4 sm:mb-5 bg-white/70 px-4 sm:px-5 py-2 rounded-full"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-gift w-4 h-4"><rect x="3" y="8" width="18" height="4" rx="1"></rect><path d="M12 8v13"></path><path d="M19 12v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-7"></path><path d="M7.5 8a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0-5A4.8 8 0 0 1 12 8a4.8 8 0 0 1 4.5-5 2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0 5"></path></svg> EXTRAATje reward system</span><h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-black text-gray-900" style="font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;">Motivated staff delivers <span class="relative inline-block"><span class="relative z-10">better service</span><span class="absolute bottom-0.5 sm:bottom-1 left-0 right-0 h-2.5 sm:h-4 bg-gradient-to-r from-yellow-400 to-orange-400 -skew-x-3 z-0 opacity-60 rounded-sm"></span></span></h2><p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-500 mt-4 max-w-2xl mx-auto">For hotels, motivation is essential. With the EXTRAATje reward system we ensure staff stay motivated and genuinely want to return to your hotel.</p></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 100ms;"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 sm:gap-6 mb-12 sm:mb-16 max-w-4xl mx-auto"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-purple-100 p-6 sm:p-8 text-center hover:shadow-xl hover:border-purple-300 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 shadow-sm"><div class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl mb-4 sm:mb-5">🏃</div><div class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-black text-purple-500 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2 sm:mb-3">Step 1</div><h4 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 sm:mb-3">Every shift earns points</h4><p class="text-gray-500 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">Staff earn points per shift. Performing well earns bonus points.</p></div><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-purple-100 p-6 sm:p-8 text-center hover:shadow-xl hover:border-purple-300 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 shadow-sm"><div class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl mb-4 sm:mb-5">💎</div><div class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-black text-purple-500 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2 sm:mb-3">Step 2</div><h4 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 sm:mb-3">Status rises, commitment grows</h4><p class="text-gray-500 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">Building up points at your hotel grows engagement and motivation.</p></div><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-purple-100 p-6 sm:p-8 text-center hover:shadow-xl hover:border-purple-300 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 shadow-sm"><div class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl mb-4 sm:mb-5">🎁</div><div class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-black text-purple-500 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2 sm:mb-3">Step 3</div><h4 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 sm:mb-3">Fewer changing faces</h4><p class="text-gray-500 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">Staff prefer to keep working at venues where they accumulate points.</p></div></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 200ms;"><div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center gap-10 lg:gap-16 max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="relative flex-shrink-0"><div class="relative w-[220px] sm:w-[280px]"><div class="relative rounded-[2.5rem] overflow-hidden shadow-2xl shadow-purple-500/20 border-[5px] border-gray-700 bg-gray-900"><div class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[35%] h-[20px] bg-gray-900 rounded-b-xl z-20"></div><div class="relative"><img src="/assets/IMG_9066_1773314165933-C-IQn_fs.webp" alt="Screenshot of the EXTRAATje dashboard in the hotel staff app: points balance, bronze status and popular rewards" class="w-full transition-opacity duration-500 opacity-100 relative"><img src="/assets/IMG_9067_1773314165933-xeTkkLxp.webp" alt="Screenshot of the rewards catalogue in the EXTRAATje app, showing redeemable gifts such as a JBL speaker and AirPods" class="w-full transition-opacity duration-500 opacity-0 absolute inset-0"><img src="/assets/IMG_9071_1773316943369-BzQi3IKk.webp" alt="Screenshot of an active challenge in the EXTRAATje app: earning extra points by working more shifts" class="w-full transition-opacity duration-500 opacity-0 absolute inset-0"><img src="/assets/IMG_9068_1773314165933-BcUul18m.webp" alt="Screenshot of the leaderboard in the EXTRAATje app showing hotel staff members' point rankings" class="w-full transition-opacity duration-500 opacity-0 absolute inset-0"></div></div><div class="absolute -inset-4 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-500/15 to-pink-500/15 rounded-[3rem] blur-3xl -z-10"></div></div><div class="flex gap-2 mt-4 justify-center"><button class="h-2.5 rounded-full transition-all duration-300 bg-purple-500 w-10"></button><button class="h-2.5 rounded-full transition-all duration-300 bg-purple-200 w-2.5 hover:bg-purple-300"></button><button class="h-2.5 rounded-full transition-all duration-300 bg-purple-200 w-2.5 hover:bg-purple-300"></button><button class="h-2.5 rounded-full transition-all duration-300 bg-purple-200 w-2.5 hover:bg-purple-300"></button></div></div><div><h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-gray-900 mb-6" style="font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;">What your hotel notices</h3><ul class="space-y-4"><li class="flex items-start gap-3"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-purple-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-trending-up w-4 h-4 text-purple-700"><polyline points="22 7 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 2 17"></polyline><polyline points="16 7 22 7 22 13"></polyline></svg></div><span class="text-gray-700 font-medium text-sm sm:text-base">Higher motivation: staff want to earn points at your hotel</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-purple-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check w-4 h-4 text-purple-700"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></div><span class="text-gray-700 font-medium text-sm sm:text-base">Fewer no-shows: reliable staff who understand what's at stake</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-purple-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-users w-4 h-4 text-purple-700"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"></path></svg></div><span class="text-gray-700 font-medium text-sm sm:text-base">More continuity: fixed faces who know your hotel inside out</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-purple-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-heart w-4 h-4 text-purple-700"><path d="M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z"></path></svg></div><span class="text-gray-700 font-medium text-sm sm:text-base">Better guest experience: motivated staff bring a smile</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div></section><section class="relative py-20 sm:py-28 lg:py-36 overflow-hidden bg-gray-50"><div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute" style="left: 5%; top: 10%; width: 200px; height: 200px; transform: rotate(15deg); opacity: 0.06; mask-image: url(&quot;/assets/X_patroon_1771260543289-Db4pmQup.webp&quot;); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center center; background-color: rgb(139, 92, 246);"></div><div class="absolute" style="left: 80%; top: 20%; width: 160px; height: 160px; transform: rotate(-25deg); opacity: 0.06; mask-image: url(&quot;/assets/X_patroon_1771260543289-Db4pmQup.webp&quot;); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center center; background-color: rgb(139, 92, 246);"></div></div><div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10"><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 0ms;"><div class="text-center mb-10 sm:mb-14"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-purple-600 font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-4 sm:mb-5 bg-purple-100/60 px-4 sm:px-5 py-2 rounded-full"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-message-circle w-4 h-4"><path d="M7.9 20A9 9 0 1 0 4 16.1L2 22Z"></path></svg> FAQ</span><h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-black text-gray-900" style="font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;">Frequently asked questions about hotel staffing</h2></div></div><div class="space-y-3 sm:space-y-4"><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 0ms;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden shadow-sm"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-7 text-left"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">How quickly can you supply hotel staff?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0"><p class="px-5 sm:px-7 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">At EXTRA we can often supply suitable hotel staff within 48 hours. Thanks to our fixed pool of selected hotel employees we can act quickly for absences, peak demand or last-minute requests. Get in touch and we'll look at what's possible straight away.</p></div></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 60ms;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden shadow-sm"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-7 text-left"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">Can you supply housekeeping staff?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0"><p class="px-5 sm:px-7 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Yes. Housekeeping is one of our core specialisations for hotels. We supply experienced room attendants who are familiar with hotel standards and quality checks. Via our favourites pool we build a fixed team that knows your hotel inside out.</p></div></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 120ms;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden shadow-sm"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-7 text-left"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">Can you supply staff for banqueting and conferences?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0"><p class="px-5 sm:px-7 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Yes. EXTRA supplies professional service and kitchen staff for banqueting, conferences and events in hotels. From small boardroom lunches to gala dinners for 300+ guests. We have experienced staff who understand how formal hotel service works.</p></div></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 180ms;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden shadow-sm"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-7 text-left"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">How does it work with fixed teams per hotel?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0"><p class="px-5 sm:px-7 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">EXTRA works with favourites pools per client. We build a fixed pool for each hotel of employees who know your location. Same faces, less explaining, higher quality. This applies per department: housekeeping, F&amp;B, banqueting and front office.</p></div></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 240ms;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden shadow-sm"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-7 text-left"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">For which hotel roles can I hire staff?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0"><p class="px-5 sm:px-7 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Via EXTRA you can hire staff for: housekeeping, front office, F&amp;B service, banqueting, kitchen (chefs, sous-chefs, kitchen workers), dishwashers and room service. We always look for the best fit for your hotel and standards.</p></div></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 300ms;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden shadow-sm"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-7 text-left"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">How is the quality of hotel staff monitored?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0"><p class="px-5 sm:px-7 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">After every shift we measure how a staff member has performed at your hotel. Scores, compliments and complaints are recorded. That way we know who structurally performs well at your location and who we give priority to for future requests.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="cta" class="relative py-20 sm:py-28 lg:py-36 overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-950 via-purple-900 to-indigo-950"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none overflow-hidden "><div class="absolute" style="left: 5%; top: 10%; width: 200px; height: 200px; transform: rotate(15deg); opacity: 0.12; mask-image: url(&quot;/assets/X_patroon_1771260543289-Db4pmQup.webp&quot;); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center center; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);"></div><div class="absolute" style="left: 80%; top: 20%; width: 160px; height: 160px; transform: rotate(-25deg); opacity: 0.12; mask-image: url(&quot;/assets/X_patroon_1771260543289-Db4pmQup.webp&quot;); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center center; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);"></div><div class="absolute" style="left: 50%; top: 60%; width: 240px; height: 240px; transform: rotate(35deg); opacity: 0.12; mask-image: url(&quot;/assets/X_patroon_1771260543289-Db4pmQup.webp&quot;); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no