:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">Will I always work at the same hotel?</span><span class="text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 "><svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg></span></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0"><p class="px-5 sm:px-7 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">In most cases yes. We try to match you to a fixed pool at one or more hotels, so you know the workflow, feel at home in the team and can be deployed quickly.</p></div></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 120ms;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden shadow-sm"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-7 text-left"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">Can I choose my own shifts?</span><span class="text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 "><svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg></span></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0"><p class="px-5 sm:px-7 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Yes. You let us know your availability and we arrange matching housekeeping shifts. This way you can combine the work with other commitments or activities.</p></div></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 180ms;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden shadow-sm"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-7 text-left"><