who could handle the pressure. Without them it would have been chaos."</p><div class="border-t border-gray-100 pt-4 mb-4"><p class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-sm">Mark de Vries</p><p class="text-gray-400 text-xs">Operations Director</p></div><div class="space-y-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-500"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check w-3.5 h-3.5 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>Full summer period covered with EXTRA support</div><div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-500"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check w-3.5 h-3.5 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>Zero uncovered shifts — quality maintained</div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="selection" class="relative py-20 sm:py-28 lg:py-36 overflow-hidden" style="background-color: rgb(243, 240, 250);"><div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none overflow-hidden "><div class="absolute" style="left: 5%; top: 10%; width: 200px; height: 200px; transform: rotate(15deg); opacity: 0.07; mask-image: url(&quot;/assets/X_patroon_1771260543289-Db4pmQup.webp&quot;); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center center; background-color: rgb(139, 92, 246);"></div><div class="absolute" style="left: 80%; top: 20%; width: 160px; height: 160px; transform: rotate(-25deg); opacity: 0.07; mask-image: url(&quot;/assets/X_patroon_1771260543289-Db4pmQup.webp&quot;); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center center; background-color: rgb(139, 92, 246);"></div><div class="absolute" style="left: 50%; top: 60%; width: 240px; height: 240px; transform: rotate(35deg); opacity: 0.07; mask-image: url(&quot;/assets/X_patroon_1771260543289-Db4pmQup.webp&quot;); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center center; background-color: rgb(139, 92, 246);"></div></div><div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10"><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center"><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 0ms;"><div><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-purple-600 font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-5 bg-purple-100/80 px-4 sm:px-5 py-2 rounded-full"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-user-check w-4 h-4"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle><polyline points="16 11 18 13 22 9"></polyline></svg> Our selection process</span><h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-gray-900 mb-8 leading-tight" style="font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;">How EXTRA picks <span class="text-purple-600">the right restaurant staff</span></h2><p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-500 leading-relaxed mb-10">Restaurant staff need to hit the ground running in a new environment. That demands experience, adaptability and the right work ethic. That's what we select on.</p><ul class="space-y-6"><li class="flex items-start gap-4 group"><div class="w-10 h-10 sm:w-11 sm:h-11 rounded-xl bg-purple-600 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5 group-hover:scale-105 group-hover:bg-purple-700 transition-all duration-300 shadow-md shadow-purple-500/20"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-users w-5 h-5 text-white"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"></path></svg></div><div><h4 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-black text-gray-900 mb-1">Personal intake interview</h4><p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Every candidate goes through a personal interview and assessment. No exceptions.</p></div></li><li class="flex items-start gap-4 group"><div class="w-10 h-10 sm:w-11 sm:h-11 rounded-xl bg-purple-600 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5 group-hover:scale-105 group-hover:bg-purple-700 transition-all duration-300 shadow-md shadow-purple-500/20"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-star w-5 h-5 text-white"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"></polygon></svg></div><div><h4 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-black text-gray-900 mb-1">Rated after every shift</h4><p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Restaurants rate our staff after each shift. Only consistent performers stay active.</p></div></li><li class="flex items-start gap-4 group"><div class="w-10 h-10 sm:w-11 sm:h-11 rounded-xl bg-purple-600 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5 group-hover:scale-105 group-hover:bg-purple-700 transition-all duration-300 shadow-md shadow-purple-500/20"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-sparkles w-5 h-5 text-white"><path d="M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .963 0L14.063 8.5