relaxed">Regular returners at your restaurant build status — from Bronze to Diamond. Higher status means stronger commitment.</p></div><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-purple-100 p-6 sm:p-8 text-center hover:shadow-xl hover:border-purple-300 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 shadow-sm"><div class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl mb-4 sm:mb-5">🎁</div><div class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-black text-purple-500 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2 sm:mb-3">Step 3</div><h4 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 sm:mb-3">Less drop-out, stronger teams</h4><p class="text-gray-500 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">Staff building points at your restaurant want to come back. Fewer no-shows, a more stable team and better continuity.</p></div></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 200ms;"><div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center gap-10 lg:gap-16 max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="relative flex-shrink-0"><div class="relative w-[220px] sm:w-[280px]"><div class="relative rounded-[2.5rem] overflow-hidden shadow-2xl shadow-purple-500/20 border-[5px] border-gray-700 bg-gray-900"><div class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[35%] h-[20px] bg-gray-900 rounded-b-xl z-20"></div><div class="relative"><img src="/assets/IMG_9066_1773314165933-C-IQn_fs.webp" alt="Screenshot of the EXTRAATje dashboard in the restaurant staff app: points balance, bronze status and popular rewards" class="w-full transition-opacity duration-500 opacity-100 relative"><img src="/assets/IMG_9067_1773314165933-xeTkkLxp.webp" alt="Screenshot of the rewards catalogue in the EXTRAATje app, showing redeemable gifts such as a JBL speaker and AirPods" class="w-full transition-opacity duration-500 opacity-0 absolute inset-0"><img src="/assets/IMG_9071_1773316943369-BzQi3IKk.webp" alt="Screenshot of an active challenge in the EXTRAATje app: earning extra points by working more shifts" class="w-full tran