w-sm"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-7 text-left"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">Kan ik meedoen als ik niet bij EXTRA werk?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0"><p class="px-5 sm:px-7 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Het EXTRAATJE systeem is exclusief voor medewerkers van EXTRA. Nog niet aangemeld? Doe dat dan via onze aanmeldpagina.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="relative bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-950 via-[#1a0a3e] to-indigo-950 py-16 sm:py-24 overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute" style="left: 5%; top: 10%; width: 200px; height: 200px; transform: rotate(15deg); opacity: 0.1; mask-image: url(&quot;/assets/X_patroon_1771260543289-Db4pmQup.webp&quot;); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center center; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);"></div><div class="absolute" style="left: 80%; top: 55%; width: 240px; height: 240px; transform: rotate(-20deg); opacity: 0.08; mask-image: url(&quot;/assets/X_patroon_1771260543289-Db4pmQup.webp&quot;); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center center; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);"></div></div><div class="relative z-10 max-w-3xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8 text-center"><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 0ms;"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-purple-300 font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-widest mb-5 bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm px-5 py-2 rounded-full border border-white/10"><svg xmlns=