line><line x1="4" x2="20" y1="6" y2="6"></line><line x1="4" x2="20" y1="18" y2="18"></line></svg></button></div></div></nav><main><section class="relative pt-32 pb-20 lg:pt-48 lg:pb-32 overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-900/30 via-[#0a0310] to-[#0a0310]"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none overflow-hidden "><div class="absolute" style="left: 5%; top: 10%; width: 200px; height: 200px; transform: rotate(15deg); opacity: 0.1; mask-image: url(&quot;/assets/X_patroon_1771260543289-Db4pmQup.webp&quot;); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center center; background-color: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.5);"></div><div class="absolute" style="left: 80%; top: 20%; width: 160px; height: 160px; transform: rotate(-25deg); opacity: 0.1; mask-image: url(&quot;/assets/X_patroon_1771260543289-Db4pmQup.webp&quot;); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center center; background-color: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.5);"></div><div class="absolute" style="left: 50%; top: 60%; width: 240px; height: 240px; transform: rotate(35deg); opacity: 0.1; mask-image: url(&quot;/assets/X_patroon_1771260543289-Db4pmQup.webp&quot;); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center center; background-color: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.5);"></div></div><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10"><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-100 translate-y-0 " style="transition-delay: 0ms;"><nav class="flex mb-8 text-sm text-purple-300/60" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol class="flex items-center space-x-2"><li><a href="/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Home</a></li><li><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right w-4 h-4"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></li><li class="text-white font-medium">Flexibel horeca personeel</li></ol></nav><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-purple-400 font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-widest mb-6 bg-purple-500/10 px-4 py-2 rounded-full border border-purple-500/20"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-zap w-4 h-4"><path d="M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z"></path></svg> Flexibel &amp; Snel</span><h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-black text-white mb-6 leading-tight" style="font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;">Wanneer jij het nodig hebt, <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-400 to-pink-400">zijn wij er</span></h1><p class="text-xl text-purple-100/70 max-w-3xl mb-10 leading-relaxed">Vang pieken op, vervang zieken direct en houd de controle over uw personeelskosten. Ontdek de kracht van flexibiliteit met de hospitality talenten van EXTRA.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4"><a href="/personeelsaanvraag" class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 bg-purple-600 hover:bg-purple-700 text-white font-bold text-lg px-8 py-4 rounded-full transition-all duration-300 shadow-xl shadow-purple-600/20 hover:scale-105">Personeel aanvragen <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right w-5 h-5 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a><a href="/contact" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-white font-bold text-lg px-8 py-4 rounded-full border border-white/20 transition-all">Stel uw vraag</a></div></div></div></section><section class="py-24 bg-[#0d0415]"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 0ms;"><div class="max-w-3xl mb-12"><h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-white mb-6" style="font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;">Vast versus Flexibel: De perfecte balans</h2><p class="text-white/60 leading-relaxed mb-4">De horeca is een wereld van uitersten. Een te groot vast team zorgt voor hoge kosten bij rustige momenten, terwijl een te klein team leidt tot overbelasting bij drukte. Door een strategische schil van <strong class="text-white/80">flexibel personeel</strong> om uw vaste kern heen te bouwen, creëert u een wendbare organisatie.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8"><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 0ms;"><div class="bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-8 hover:bg-white/10 hover:border-purple-500/30 transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-12 h-12 bg-purple-500/20 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:bg-purple-500/30 transition-colors"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-trending-up w-6 h-6 text-purple-400"><polyline points="22 7 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 2 17"></polyline><polyline points="16 7 22 7 22 13"></polyline></svg></div><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Schaalbaarheid</h3><p class="text-white/60 leading-relaxed">Schakel moeiteloos op tijdens feestdagen, events of het terrasseizoen zonder langetermijnverplichtingen.</p></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 120ms;"><div class="bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-8 hover:bg-white/10 hover:border-purple-500/30 transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-12 h-12 bg-purple-500/20 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:bg-purple-500/30 transition-colors"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clock w-6 h-6 text-purple-400"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"></polyline></svg></div><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Kostenbeheersing</h3><p class="text-white/60 leading-relaxed">U betaalt alleen voor de gewerkte uren. Geen doorbetaling bij ziekte of rustige periodes voor de flexibele schil.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><div class="relative h-16 overflow-hidden"><svg viewBox="0 0 1440 64" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path d="M0 64L720 0L1440 64H0Z" fill="#0d0415"></path></svg></div><section class="py-24 bg-[#0a0310]"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-5"><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 0ms;"><h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-white mb-6" style="font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;">Hoe EXTRA de pieken en dalen oplost</h2><p class="text-white/60 leading-relaxed mb-6">Bij EXTRA hebben we ons proces volledig ingericht op snelheid en kwaliteit. Wij begrijpen dat 'nu nodig' ook echt 'nu' betekent. Ons bestand aan medewerkers in Amsterdam is groot genoeg om op zeer korte termijn gaten in uw rooster op te vullen.</p><p class="text-white/60 leading-relaxed mb-12">Maar flexibiliteit mag nooit ten koste gaan van kwaliteit. Daarom investeren we in onze mensen. Door het unieke beloningssysteem van EXTRA voelen onze flexibele medewerkers zich net zo verantwoordelijk voor het resultaat als uw vaste team.</p><h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-white mb-6" style="font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;">De voordelen van uitbesteden via EXTRA</h2><div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4"><div class="bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-5 hover:bg-white/8 transition-colors"><h4 class="font-bold text-white mb-1">Werving &amp; Selectie</h4><p class="text-sm text-white/50">Wij zoeken continu naar de beste hospitality talenten.</p></div><div class="bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-5 hover:bg-white/8 transition-colors"><h4 class="font-bold text-white mb-1">Planning</h4><p class="text-sm text-white/50">Geen eindeloos gebel; wij regelen de poppetjes op de juiste plek.</p></div><div class="bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-5 hover:bg-white/8 transition-colors"><h4 class="font-bold text-white mb-1">Verloning &amp; Administratie</h4><p class="text-sm text-white/50">Geen zorgen over contracten, pensioenen of verzekeringen.</p></div><div class="bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-5 hover:bg-white/8 transition-colors"><h4 class="font-bold text-white mb-1">Kwaliteitscontrole</h4><p class="text-sm text-white/50">Wij monitoren prestaties en sturen bij waar nodig.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20 bg-[#0d0415]"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-5"><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 0ms;"><h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-white mb-6" style="font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;">Continuïteit in uw bedrijfsvoering</h2><p class="text-white/60 leading-relaxed mb-4">Een stabiele bezetting is de droom van elke manager. Door een partner als EXTRA in de arm te nemen voor uw <strong class="text-white/80">flexibele schil</strong>, bouwt u aan die continuïteit. We streven ernaar om vaak dezelfde gezichten naar uw locatie te sturen, zodat de inwerktijd minimaal is en de binding met uw gasten maximaal.</p><p class="text-white/60 leading-relaxed">Wilt u meer weten over onze specifieke focus in de hoofdstad? Bekijk dan onze pagina over ons <a href="/horeca-uitzendbureau-amsterdam" class="text-purple-400 hover:text-purple-300 underline underline-offset-2">horeca uitzendbureau in Amsterdam</a> of lees meer over <a href="/horeca-personeel-amsterdam" class="text-purple-400 hover:text-purple-300 underline underline-offset-2">horeca personeel in Amsterdam</a>.</p></div></div></section><section class="relative py-20 bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-600 to-violet-700 overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none overflow-hidden "><div class="absolute" style="left: 5%; top: 10%; width: 200px; height: 200px; transform: rotate(15deg); opacity: 0.08; mask-image: url(&quot;/assets/X_patroon_1771260543289-Db4pmQup.webp&quot;); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center center; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"></div><div class="absolute" style="left: 80%; top: 20%; width: 160px; height: 160px; transform: rotate(-25deg); opacity: 0.08; mask-image: url(&quot;/assets/X_patroon_1771260543289-Db4pmQup.webp&quot;); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center center; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"></div></div><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-5 text-center relative z-10"><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 0ms;"><h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-white mb-6" style="font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;">Flexibiliteit die loont</h2><p class="text-xl text-purple-100 mb-10">Ontvang een voorstel voor uw flexibele personeelsschil.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4"><a href="/personeelsaanvraag" class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 bg-white text-purple-700 font-bold text-lg px-8 py-4 rounded-full hover:bg-purple-50 transition-all hover:scale-105 shadow-2xl">Personeel aanvragen <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right w-5 h-5 transition-transform group