lass="text-gray-700 font-medium text-sm sm:text-base">Medewerkers die graag terugkomen naar jouw locatie</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div></section><section id="betrouwbaarheid" class="relative py-20 sm:py-28 lg:py-36 overflow-hidden bg-white"><div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none overflow-hidden "><div class="absolute" style="left: 5%; top: 10%; width: 200px; height: 200px; transform: rotate(15deg); opacity: 0.07; mask-image: url(&quot;/assets/X_patroon_1771260543289-Db4pmQup.webp&quot;); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center center; background-color: rgb(139, 92, 246);"></div><div class="absolute" style="left: 80%; top: 20%; width: 160px; height: 160px; transform: rotate(-25deg); opacity: 0.07; mask-image: url(&quot;/assets/X_patroon_1771260543289-Db4pmQup.webp&quot;); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center center; background-color: rgb(139, 92, 246);"></div><div class="absolute" style="left: 50%; top: 60%; width: 240px; height: 240px; transform: rotate(35deg); opacity: 0.07; mask-image: url(&quot;/assets/X_patroon_1771260543289-Db4pmQup.webp&quot;); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center center; background-color: rgb(139, 92, 246);"></div></div><div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10"><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 0ms;"><div class="text-center mb-10 sm:mb-16"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-purple-600 font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-4 sm:mb-5 bg-purple-100/60 px-4 sm:px-5 py-2 rounded-full"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-lock w-4 h-4"><rect width="18" height="11" x="3" y="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path></svg> Betrouwbaarheid</span><h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-black text-gray-900" style="font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;">No-shows tolereren we niet</h2><p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-500 mt-4 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Een betrouwbare medewerker meld zich correct af. Doet hij dat niet? Dan zijn er gevolgen. Zo zorgen we dat jij nooit voor verrassingen staat.</p></div></div><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 sm:gap-6 mb-12 sm:mb-16"><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 0ms;"><div class="group bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-50 to-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-purple-500/10 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 h-full shadow-sm"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-500 to-indigo-600 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300 shadow-md"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-bell w-6 h-6 text-white"><path d="M6 8a6 6 0 0 1 12 0c0 7 3 9 3 9H3s3-2 3-9"></path><path d="M10.3 21a1.94 1.94 0 0 0 3.4 0"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-black text-gray-900 mb-2 sm:mb-3">Altijd bellen bij afmelding</h3><p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Medewerkers zijn verplicht telefonisch af te melden. Een appje of bericht is niet voldoende.</p></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 80ms;"><div class="group bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-50 to-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-purple-500/10 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 h-full shadow-sm"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-500 to-red-500 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300 shadow-md"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-alert w-6 h-6 text-white"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="8" y2="12"></line><line x1="12" x2="12.01" y1="16" y2="16"></line></svg></div><h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-black text-gray-900 mb-2 sm:mb-3">€50 boete bij onjuiste afmelding</h3><p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Wie zich niet volgens het protocol afmeldt, krijgt een boete van €50. Direct, consequent en eerlijk.</p></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 160ms;"><div class="group bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-50 to-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-purple-500/10 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 h-full shadow-sm"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-red-500 to-rose-600 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300 shadow-md"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-lock w-6 h-6 text-white"><rect width="18" height="11" x="3" y="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-black text-gray-900 mb-2 sm:mb-3">2x onjuist = non-actief</h3><p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Na twee onjuiste afmeldingen wordt een medewerker op non-actief gezet. Geen tweede kans voor slordigheid.</p></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 240ms;"><div class="group bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-50 to-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-purple-500/10 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 h-full shadow-sm"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-green-500 to-emerald-600 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300 shadow-md"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield w-6 h-6 text-white"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-black text-gray-900 mb-2 sm:mb-3">Jij staat nooit voor een verrassing</h3><p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Dankzij dit protocol weet je tijdig wanneer iemand niet kan. Zodat wij een vervanging kunnen regelen.</p></div></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 350ms;"><div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-900 via-purple-800 to-indigo-900 rounded-2xl sm:rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-10 text-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check w-10 h-10 text-green-400 mx-auto mb-4"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-white mb-3" style="font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;">Betrouwbaarheid is geen bijzaak bij EXTRA</h3><p class="text-purple-200/80 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed max-w-xl mx-auto">Ons afmeldprotocol is er niet voor de vorm. Het beschermt jou als opdrachtgever en zorgt dat medewerkers serieus worden genomen in hun verantwoordelijkheid.</p></div></div></div></section><section id="werkwijze" class="relative py-20 sm:py-28 lg:py-36 overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-950 via-purple-900 to-indigo-950"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none overflow-hidden "><div class="absolute" style="left: 5%; top: 10%; width: 200px; height: 200px; transform: rotate(15deg); opacity: 0.12; mask-image: url(&quot;/assets/X_patroon_1771260543289-Db4pmQup.webp&quot;); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center center; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);"></div><div class="absolute" style="left: 80%; top: 20%; width: 160px; height: 160px; transform: rotate(-25deg); opacity: 0.12; mask-image: url(&quot;/assets/X_patroon_1771260543289-Db4pmQup.webp&quot;); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center center; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);"></div><div class="absolute" style="left: 50%; top: 60%; width: 240px; height: 240px; transform: rotate(35deg); opacity: 0.12; mask-image: url(&quot;/assets/X_patroon_1771260543289-Db4pmQup.webp&quot;); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center center; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);"></div><div class="absolute" style="left: 15%; top: 75%; width: 180px; height: 180px; transform: rotate(-10deg); opacity: 0.12; mask-image: url(&quot;/assets/X_patroon_1771260543289-Db4pmQup.webp&quot;); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center center; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);"></div><div class="absolute" style="left: 90%; top: 80%; width: 140px; height: 140px; transform: rotate(45deg); opacity: 0.12; mask-image: url(&quot;/assets/X_patroon_1771260543289-Db4pmQup.webp&quot;); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center center; ba