"transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-100 translate-y-0 " style="transition-delay: 0ms;"><nav class="flex mb-8 text-sm text-purple-300/60" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol class="flex items-center space-x-2"><li><a href="/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Home</a></li><li><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right w-4 h-4"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></li><li class="text-white font-medium">Horeca uitzendbureau Amsterdam</li></ol></nav><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-purple-400 font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-widest mb-6 bg-purple-500/10 px-4 py-2 rounded-full border border-purple-500/20"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-building2 w-4 h-4"><path d="M6 22V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v18Z"></path><path d="M6 12H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2"></path><path d="M18 9h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v9a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2"></path><path d="M10 6h4"></path><path d="M10 10h4"></path><path d="M10 14h4"></path><path d="M10 18h4"></path></svg> Horeca Uitzendbureau Amsterdam</span><h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-black text-white mb-6 leading-tight" style="font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;">Dé horecapartner <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-400 to-pink-400">van Amsterdam</span></h1><p class="text-xl text-purple-100/70 max-w-3xl mb-10 leading-relaxed">Bent u op zoek naar een betrouwbare partner die niet alleen handjes levert, maar echte gastvrijheid begrijpt? EXTRA is hét horeca uitzendbureau van Amsterdam, gespecialiseerd in het leveren van getraind personeel voor hotels, evenementen, cateraars en restaurants.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4"><a href="/personeelsaanvraag" class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 bg-purple-600 hover:bg-purple-700 text-white font-bold text-lg px-8 py-4 rounded-full transition-all duration-300 shadow-xl shadow-purple-600/20 hover:scale-105">Personeel aanvragen <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right w-5 h-5 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a><a href="/horeca-vacatures-amsterdam" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-white font-bold text-lg px-8 py-4 rounded-full border border-white/20 transition-all">Ik zoek werk</a></div></div></div></section><section class="py-24 bg-[#0d0415]"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 0ms;"><h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-white mb-4" style="font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;">De nieuwe standaard in horeca-uitzending</h2><p class="text-white/60 max-w-2xl mb-12 leading-relaxed">De Amsterdamse horeca is dynamisch, veeleisend en altijd in beweging. Bij EXTRA hebben we een unieke aanpak ontwikkeld die focust op kwaliteit, betrokkenheid en continuïteit. Wij werken uitsluitend met personeel in loondienst, wat zekerheid geeft voor u en loyaliteit van onze medewerkers.</p><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white/80 mb-8">Gespecialiseerd in diverse branches</h3><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6"><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 0ms;"><a href="/hotel-personeel-amsterdam" class="group block bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-white/10 hover:border-purple-500/40 transition-all duration-300"><h4 class="font-bold text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-purple-300 transition-colors">Hotel personeel</h4><p class="text-sm text-white/50 leading-relaxed">Housekeeping, receptie en F&amp;B medewerkers voor de top van de Amsterdamse hotellerie.</p><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-purple-400 text-sm font-bold mt-4 group-hover:gap-2 transition-all">Meer info <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span></a></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 100ms;"><a href="/evenementen-personeel-amsterdam" class="group block bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-white/10 hover:border-purple-500/40 transition-all duration-300"><h4 class="font-bold text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-purple-300 transition-colors">Evenementen personeel</h4><p class="text-sm text-white/50 leading-relaxed">Professionele gastheren, gastvrouwen en bediening voor zakelijke events en publieksbeurzen.</p><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-purple-400 text-sm font-bold mt-4 group-hover:gap-2 transition-all">Meer info <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span></a></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 200ms;"><a href="/catering-personeel-amsterdam" class="group block bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-white/10 hover:border-purple-500/40 transition-all duration-300"><h4 class="font-bold text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-purple-300 transition-colors">Catering personeel</h4><p class="text-sm text-white/50 leading-relaxed">Flexibele krachten voor bedrijfscatering en partycatering op locatie.</p><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-purple-400 text-sm font-bold mt-4 group-hover:gap-2 transition-all">Meer info <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span></a></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 300ms;"><a href="/restaurant-personeel-amsterdam" class="group block bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-white/10 hover:border-purple-500/40 transition-all duration-300"><h4 class="font-bold text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-purple-300 transition-colors">Restaurant personeel</h4><p class="text-sm text-white/50 leading-relaxed">Ervaren kelners en barpersoneel die direct mee kunnen draaien in uw service.</p><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-purple-400 text-sm font-bold mt-4 group-hover:gap-2 transition-all">Meer info <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span></a></div></div></div></div></section><div class="relative h-16 overflow-hidden"><svg viewBox="0 0 1440 64" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path d="M0 64L720 0L1440 64H0Z" fill="#0d0415"></path></svg></div><section class="py-24 bg-[#0a0310]"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 0ms;"><div class="text-center mb-16"><h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-white mb-4" style="font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;">Waarom kiezen voor EXTRA?</h2><p class="text-white/60 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Wij zijn meer dan een uitzendbureau; wij zijn een verlengstuk van uw team.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8"><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 0ms;"><div class="bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-8 hover:bg-white/10 hover:border-purple-500/30 transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-12 h-12 bg-purple-500/20 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:bg-purple-500/30 transition-colors"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check w-6 h-6 text-purple-400"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Lokaal Focus</h3><p class="text-white/60 leading-relaxed">We kennen de Amsterdamse markt als onze broekzak. Onze mensen wonen in de stad en kennen de weg.</p></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 120ms;"><div class="bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-8 hover:bg-white/10 hover:border-purple-500/30 transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-12 h-12 bg-purple-500/20 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:bg-purple-500/30 transition-colors"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check w-6 h-6 text-purple-400"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">EXTRA Academy</h3><p class="text-white/60 leading-relaxed">Iedereen wordt getraind voordat ze aan de slag gaan. Gastvrijheid zit in ons DNA.</p></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 240ms;"><div class="bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-8 hover:bg-white/10 hover:border-purple-500/30 transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-12 h-12 bg-purple-500/20 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:bg-purple-500/30 transition-colors"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check w-6 h-6 text-purple-400"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Beloningssysteem</h3><p class="text-white/60 leading-relaxed">Ons unieke EXTRAATje systeem motiveert medewerkers om elke dienst boven verwachting te presteren.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-24 bg-[#0d0415]"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-5"><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 0ms;"><h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-white mb-6" style="font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;">Het EXTRAATje: Onze drijfveer</h2><p class="text-white/60 leading-relaxed mb-6">Wat EXTRA uniek maakt in de wereld van <strong class="text-white/80">horeca uitzendbureaus in Amsterdam</strong>, is ons beloningssysteem: het EXTRAATje. We geloven dat waardering de sleutel is tot uitmuntende service. Onze medewerkers sparen punten bij elke gewerkte dienst, maar ze verdienen extra punten voor punctualiteit, positieve feedback van u als klant en proactief handelen.</p><p class="text-white/60 leading-relaxed mb-12">Deze punten kunnen zij verzilveren voor waardevolle beloningen, variërend van bioscoopbonnen en hippe gadgets tot unieke ervaringen. Het resultaat? Medewerkers die met een glimlach op de werkvloer verschijnen en altijd bereid zijn die 'extra' stap te zetten.</p><h3 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">Flexibiliteit zonder zorgen</h3><p class="text-white/60 leading-relaxed mb-6">Horeca is hollen of stilstaan. Onze systemen zijn erop ingericht om snel te kunnen schakelen. Via ons platform kunt u eenvoudig aanvragen doen en ziet u direct wie er komt werken. Doordat wij alle administratieve lasten, verzekeringen en loonbetalingen op ons nemen, kunt u zich volledig focussen op uw gasten.</p></div></div></section><section class="relative py-20 bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-600 to-violet-700 overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none overflow-hidden "><div class="absolute" style="left: 5%; top: 10%; width: 200px; height: 200px; transform: rotate(15deg); opacity: 0.08; mask-image: url(&quot;/assets/X_patroon_1771260543289-Db4pmQup.webp&quot;); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center center; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"></div><div class="absolute" style="left: 80%; top: 20%; width: 160px; height: 160px; transform: rotate(-25deg); opacity: 0.08; mask-image: url(&quot;/assets/X_patroon_1771260543289-Db4pmQup.webp&quot;); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center center; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"></div></div><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-5 text-center relative z-10"><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 0ms;"><h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-white mb-6" style="font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;">Klaar om de service naar een hoger niveau te tillen?</h2><p class="text-xl text-purple-100 mb-10">Neem contact met ons op voor een vrijblijvend kennismakingsgesprek of doe direct een personeelsaanvraag.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4"><a href="/personeelsaanvraag" class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 bg-white text-purple-700 font-bold text-lg px-8 py-4 rounded-full hover:bg-purple-50 transition-all hover:scale-105 