vice en horecavaardigheden.</p><ul class="space-y-6"><li class="flex items-start gap-4 group"><div class="w-10 h-10 sm:w-11 sm:h-11 rounded-xl bg-purple-600 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5 group-hover:scale-105 group-hover:bg-purple-700 transition-all duration-300 shadow-md shadow-purple-500/20"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-users w-5 h-5 text-white"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"></path></svg></div><div><h4 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-black text-gray-900 mb-1">Persoonlijke intake</h4><p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Iedere medewerker doorloopt een gesprek en beoordeling voordat hij of zij aan de slag kan. Geen uitzonderingen.</p></div></li><li class="flex items-start gap-4 group"><div class="w-10 h-10 sm:w-11 sm:h-11 rounded-xl bg-purple-600 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5 group-hover:scale-105 group-hover:bg-purple-700 transition-all duration-300 shadow-md shadow-purple-500/20"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-star w-5 h-5 text-white"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"></polygon></svg></div><div><h4 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-black text-gray-900 mb-1">Beoordeling na iedere dienst</h4><p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Restaurants geven feedback na elke dienst. Alleen medewerkers die structureel goed presteren blijven actief bij EXTRA.</p></div></li><li class="flex items-start gap-4 group"><div class="w-10 h-10 sm:w-11 sm:h-11 rounded-xl bg-purple-600 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5 group-hover:scale-105 group-hover:bg-purple-700 transition-all duration-300 shadow-md shadow-purple-500/20"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-sparkles w-5 h-5 text-white"><path d="M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .963 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.581a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .964L15.5 14.063a2 2 0 0 0-1.437 1.437l-1.582 6.135a.5.5 0 0 1-.963 0z"></path><path d="M20 3v4"></path><path d="M22 5h-4"></path><path d="M4 17v2"></path><path d="M5 18H3"></path></svg></div><div><h4 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-black text-gray-900 mb-1">Representativiteit</h4><p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">In een restaurant staat het personeel in het middelpunt. Onze medewerkers zijn verzorgd, gastgericht en beheersen de taal van de gastvrijheid.</p></div></li><li class="flex items-start gap-4 group"><div class="w-10 h-10 sm:w-11 sm:h-11 rounded-xl bg-purple-600 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5 group-hover:scale-105 group-hover:bg-purple-700 transition-all duration-300 shadow-md shadow-purple-500/20"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-thumbs-up w-5 h-5 text-white"><path d="M7 10v12"></path><path d="M15 5.88 14 10h5.83a2 2 0 0 1 1.92 2.56l-2.33 8A2 2 0 0 1 17.5 22H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2.76a2 2 0 0 0 1.79-1.11L12 2a3.13 3.13 0 0 1 3 3.88Z"></path></svg></div><div><h4 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-black text-gray-900 mb-1">Horecaervaring &amp; houding</h4><p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relax