path d="M7.9 20A9 9 0 1 0 4 16.1L2 22Z"></path></svg> FAQ</span><h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-black text-gray-900" style="font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;">Veelgestelde vragen over restaurantpersoneel</h2></div></div><div class="space-y-3 sm:space-y-4"><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 0ms;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden shadow-sm"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-7 text-left"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">Kunnen jullie snel horecapersoneel leveren voor een restaurant?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0"><p class="px-5 sm:px-7 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Ja. In veel gevallen leveren we binnen 48 uur geschikt horecapersoneel. Dankzij onze pool van ervaren medewerkers kunnen we snel schakelen bij uitval, ziekte of onverwachte drukte in jouw restaurant.</p></div></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 60ms;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden shadow-sm"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-7 text-left"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">Hebben jullie ervaren bediening voor restaurants?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0"><p class="px-5 sm:px-7 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Ja. Onze bedienend personeel heeft ruime horecaervaring en is gewend aan het tempo van een druk restaurant. Ze kennen de omgangsvormen, werken zelfstandig en zijn representatief.</p></div></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 120ms;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden shadow-sm"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-7 text-left"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">Kunnen jullie ook keukenpersoneel leveren voor een restaurant?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0"><p class="px-5 sm:px-7 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Ja. EXTRA levert zelfstandig werkende koks, sous-chefs, keukenhulpen en afwassers. We selecteren op keukenervaring en het vermogen om direct zelfstandig mee te draaien in een vreemde keuken.</p></div></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 180ms;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden shadow-sm"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-7 text-left"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">Kunnen wij werken met vaste medewerkers via EXTRA?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0"><p class="px-5 sm:px-7 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Ja. Via het favorietenpoule systeem bouwen we per restaurant een vaste groep medewerkers op. Ze kennen jouw menu, je werkwijze en jouw kwaliteitsstandaard. Minder uitleg, meer kwaliteit bij elke dienst.</p></div></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 240ms;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden shadow-sm"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-7 text-left"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">Kunnen jullie personeel leveren voor weekenden en piekperiodes?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0"><p class="px-5 sm:px-7 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Ja. Juist voor drukke weekenden, vakanties en piekperiodes is EXTRA de aangewezen partner. We leveren flexibel horecapersoneel dat gewend is aan hoog tempo en wisselende drukte.</p></div></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 300ms;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden shadow-sm"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-7 text-left"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">Zijn jullie medewerkers in loondienst?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0"><p class="px-5 sm:px-7 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Ja. Alle medewerkers die via EXTRA werken zijn in loondienst bij ons. We voldoen aan de NEN 4400-1 norm. Geen zzp-risico voor jouw restaurant, geen schijnzelfstandigheid.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="cta" class="relative py-20 sm:py-28 lg:py-36 overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-950 via-purple-900 to-indigo-950"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none overflow-hidden "><div class="absolute" style="left: 5%; top: 10%; width: 200px; height: 200px; transform: rotate(15deg); opacity: 0.12; mask-image: url(&quot;/assets/X_patroon_1771260543289-Db4pmQup.webp&quot;); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center center; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);"></div><div class="absolute" style="left: 80%; top: 20%; width: 160px; height: 160px; transform: rotate(-25deg); opacity: 0.12; mask-image: url(&quot;/assets/X_patroon_1771260543289-Db4pmQup.webp&quot;); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center center; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);"></div><div class="absolute" style="left: 50%; top: 60%; width: 240px; height: 240px; transform: rotate(35deg); opacity: 0.12; mask-image: url(&quot;/assets/X_patroon_1771260543289-Db4pmQup.webp&quot;); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center center; backgrou