adow-xl hover:shadow-purple-500/10 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 h-full shadow-sm"><div class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:rotate-6 transition-all duration-300">📊</div><h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-black text-gray-900 mb-2 sm:mb-3">Data per medewerker per hotel</h3><p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Na iedere dienst meten we prestaties. Zo weten we precies wie op jouw locatie het beste presteert.</p></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 400ms;"><div class="group bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-50 to-white rounded-2xl sm:rounded-[1.5rem] p-6 sm:p-8 border border-purple-100 hover:border-purple-300 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-purple-500/10 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 h-full shadow-sm"><div class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:rotate-6 transition-all duration-300">🛡️</div><h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-black text-gray-900 mb-2 sm:mb-3">Volledig in loondienst</h3><p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">NEN 4400 1 gecertificeerd en conform arbeidswetgeving. Geen zzp risico's voor hotels.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-10 sm:py-16 bg-white border-y border-gray-100 relative overflow-hidden"><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 0ms;"><p class="text-center text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-8 sm:mb-12">Vertrouwd door toonaangevende hotelketens in Amsterdam</p></div><div class="relative group overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute left-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-16 sm:w-32 bg-gradient-to-r from-white to-transparent z-10"></div><div class="absolute right-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-16 sm:w-32 bg-gradient-to-l from-white to-transparent z-10"></div><div class="flex animate-marquee-hotel group-hover:[animation-play-state:paused]"><div class="flex 