eel</h2></div></div><div class="space-y-3 sm:space-y-4"><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 0ms;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden shadow-sm"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-7 text-left"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">Hoe snel kunnen jullie hotelpersoneel leveren?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0"><p class="px-5 sm:px-7 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Bij EXTRA kunnen we in veel gevallen binnen 48 uur geschikt hotelpersoneel leveren. Dankzij onze vaste poule van geselecteerde hotelmedewerkers kunnen we snel schakelen bij uitval, piekdrukte of last-minute aanvragen. Neem contact op en we kijken direct wat mogelijk is.</p></div></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 60ms;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden shadow-sm"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-7 text-left"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">Kunnen jullie housekeeping personeel leveren?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0"><p class="px-5 sm:px-7 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Ja. Housekeeping is één van onze kernspecialisaties voor hotels. We leveren ervaren kamermeisjes en room attendants die vertrouwd zijn met hotelstandaarden en kwaliteitscontroles. Via onze favorietenpoule bouwen we een vast team op dat jouw hotel door en door kent.</p></div></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 120ms;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden shadow-sm"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-7 text-left"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">Kunnen jullie personeel leveren voor banqueting en conferenties?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0"><p class="px-5 sm:px-7 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Ja. EXTRA levert professionele bediening en keukenmedewerkers voor banqueting, conferenties en events in hotels. Van kleine boardroom-lunches tot gala-diners van 300+ gasten. We hebben ervaren medewerkers die weten hoe formele hotelservice werkt.</p></div></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 180ms;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden shadow-sm"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-7 text-left"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">Hoe werkt het met vaste teams per hotel?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0"><p class="px-5 sm:px-7 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">EXTRA werkt met favorietenpoules per opdrachtgever. We bouwen per hotel een vaste poule op van medewerkers die jouw locatie kennen. Dezelfde gezichten, minder uitleg, hogere kwaliteit. Dit geldt per afdeling: housekeeping, F&amp;B, banqueting en front office.</p></div></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 240ms;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden shadow-sm"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-7 text-left"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">Voor welke hotelfuncties kan ik personeel inhuren?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0"><p class="px-5 sm:px-7 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Via EXTRA kun je personeel inhuren voor: housekeeping, front office, F&amp;B bediening, banqueting, keuken (chefs, sous-chefs, keukenmedewerkers), afwassers en roomservice. We kijken altijd welke medewerkers het beste passen bij jouw hotel en standaard.</p></div></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 300ms;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden shadow-sm"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-7 text-left"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">Hoe wordt de kwaliteit van hotelpersoneel bewaakt?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0"><p class="px-5 sm:px-7 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Na elke dienst meten we hoe een medewerker heeft gepresteerd bij jouw hotel. Scores, complimenten en klachten worden geregistreerd. Zo weten we wie structureel goed presteert op jouw locatie en wie we prioriteit geven bij toekomstige aanvragen.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="cta" class="relative py-20 sm:py-28 lg:py-36 overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-950 via-purple-900 to-indigo-950"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none overflow-hidden "><div class="absolute" style="left: 5%; top: 10%; width: 200px; height: 200px; transform: rotate(15deg); opacity: 0.12; mask-image: url(&quot;/assets/X_patroon_1771260543289-Db4pmQup.webp&quot;); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center center; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);"></div><div class="absolute" style="left: 80%; top: 20%; width: 160px; height: 160px; transform: rotate(-25deg); opacity: 0.12; mask-image: url(&quot;/assets/X_patroon_1771260543289-Db4pmQup.webp&quot;); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center center; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);"></div><div class="absolute" style="left: 50%; top: 60%; width: 240px; height: 240px; transform: rotate(35deg);