ive z-10"><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 0ms;"><div class="text-center mb-12 sm:mb-20"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-purple-600 font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-4 sm:mb-5 bg-white/70 px-4 sm:px-5 py-2 rounded-full"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-gift w-4 h-4"><rect x="3" y="8" width="18" height="4" rx="1"></rect><path d="M12 8v13"></path><path d="M19 12v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-7"></path><path d="M7.5 8a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0-5A4.8 8 0 0 1 12 8a4.8 8 0 0 1 4.5-5 2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0 5"></path></svg> EXTRAATje beloningssysteem</span><h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-black text-gray-900" style="font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;">Gemotiveerd personeel levert <span class="relative inline-block"><span class="relative z-10">betere service</span><span class="absolute bottom-0.5 sm:bottom-1 left-0 right-0 h-2.5 sm:h-4 bg-gradient-to-r from-yellow-400 to-orange-400 -skew-x-3 z-0 opacity-60 rounded-sm"></span></span></h2><p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-500 mt-4 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Voor hotels is motivatie essentieel. Met het EXTRAATje beloningssysteem zorgen we dat medewerkers gemotiveerd blijven en graag terugkomen naar jouw hotel.</p></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 100ms;"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 sm:gap-6 mb-12 sm:mb-16 max-w-4xl mx-auto"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-purple-100 p-6 sm:p-8 text-center hover:shadow-xl hover:border-purple-300 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 shadow-sm"><div class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl mb-4 sm:mb-5">🏃</div><div class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-black text-purple-500 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2 sm:mb-3">Stap 1</div><h4 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 sm:mb-3">Elke dienst levert punten op</h4><p class="text-gray-500 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">Medewerkers verdienen punten per dienst. Goed presteren levert bonuspunten op.</p></div><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-purple-100 p-6 sm:p-8 text-center hover:shadow-xl hover:border-purple-300 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 shadow-sm"><div class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl mb-4 sm:mb-5">💎</div><div class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-black text-purple-500 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2 sm:mb-3">Stap 2</div><h4 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 sm:mb-3">Status stijgt, binding groeit</h4><p class="text-gray-500 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">Door punten op te bouwen bij jouw hotel groeit betrokkenheid en motivatie.</p></div><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-purple-100 p-6 sm:p-8 text-center hover:shadow-xl hover:border-purple-300 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 shadow-sm"><div class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl mb-4 sm:mb-5">🎁</div><div class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-black text-purple-500 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2 sm:mb-3">Stap 3</div><h4 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 sm:mb-3">Minder wisselende gezichten</h4><p class="text-gray-500 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">Medewerkers blijven graag werken op locaties waar zij punten opbouwen.</p></div></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 200ms;"><div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center gap-10 lg:gap-16 max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="relative flex-shrink-0"><div class="relative w-[220px] sm:w-[280px]"><div class="relative rounded-[2.5rem] overflow-hidden shadow-2xl shadow-purple-500/20 border-[5px] border-gray-700 bg-gray-900"><div class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[35%] h-[20px] bg-gray-900 rounded-b-xl z-20"></div><div class="relative"><img src="/assets/IMG_9066_1773314165933-C-IQn_fs.webp" alt="Schermafbeelding van het EXTRAATje-dashboard in de app van hotelmedewerkers: puntensaldo, bronsstatus en populaire beloningen" class="w-full transition-opacity duration-500 opacity-100 relative"><img src="/assets/IMG_9067_1773314165933-xeTkkLxp.webp" alt="Schermafbeelding van het beloningenoverzicht in de EXTRAATje-app, met te claimen cadeaus zoals een JBL-speaker en AirPods" class="w-full transition-opacity duration-500 opacity-0 absolute inset-0"><img src="/assets/IMG_9071_1773316943369-BzQi3IKk.webp" alt="Schermafbeelding van een actieve uitdaging in de EXTRAATje-app: extra punten verdienen door meer diensten te draaien" class="w-full transition-opacity duration-500 opacity-0 absolute inset-0"><img src="/assets/IMG_9068_1773314165933-BcUul18m.webp" alt="Schermafbeelding van de ranglijst in de EXTRAATje-app met de puntenposities van hotelmedewerkers" class="w-full transition-opacity duration-500 opacity-0 absolute inset-0"></div></div><div class="absolute -inset-4 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-500/15 to-pink-500/15 rounded-[3rem] blur-3xl -z-10"></div></div><div class="flex gap-2 mt-4 justify-center"><button class="h-2.5 rounded-full transition-all duration-300 bg-purple-500 w-10"></button><button class="h-2.5 rounded-full transition-all duration-300 bg-purple-200 w-2.5 hover:bg-purple-300"></button><button class="h-2.5 rounded-full transition-all duration-300 bg-purple-200 w-2.5 hover:bg-purple-300"></button><button class="h-2.5 rounded-full transition-all duration-300 bg-purple-200 w-2.5 hover:bg-purple-300"></button></div></div><div><h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-gray-900 mb-6" style="font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;">Wat jouw hotel hiervan merkt</h3><ul class="space-y-4"><li class="flex items-start gap-3"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-purple-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-trending-up w-4 h-4 text-purple-700"><polyline points="22 7 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 2 17"></polyline><polyline points="16 7 22 7 22 13"></polyline></svg></div><span class="text-gray-700 font-medium text-sm sm:text-base">Hogere motivatie: medewerkers willen punten verdienen in jouw hotel</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-purple-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check w-4 h-4 text-purple-700"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></div><span class="text-gray-700 font-medium text-sm sm:text-base">Minder no-shows: betrouwbare medewerkers die weten wat er op het spel staat</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-purple-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-users w-4 h-4 text-purple-700"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"></path></svg></div><span class="text-gray-700 font-medium text-sm sm:text-base">Meer continuïteit: vaste gezichten die jouw hotel door en door kennen</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-purple-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-heart w-4 h-4 text-purple-700"><path d="M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z"></path></svg></div><span class="text-gray-700 font-medium text-sm sm:text-base">Betere gastbeleving: gemotiveerd personeel zorgt voor een glimlach</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div></section><section class="relative py-20 sm:py-28 lg:py-36 overflow-hidden bg-gray-50"><div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute" style="left: 5%; top: 10%; width: 200px; height: 200px; transform: rotate(15deg); opacity: 0.06; mask-image: url(&quot;/assets/X_patroon_1771260543289-Db4pmQup.webp&quot;); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center center; background-color: rgb(139, 92, 246);"></div><div class="absolute" style="left: 80%; top: 20%; width: 160px; height: 160px; transform: rotate(-25deg); opacity: 0.06; mask-image: url(&quot;/assets/X_patroon_1771260543289-Db4pmQup.webp&quot;); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center center; background-color: rgb(139, 92, 246);"></div></div><div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10"><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 0ms;"><div class="text-center mb-10 sm:mb-14"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-purple-600 font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-4 sm:mb-5 bg-purple-100/60 px-4 sm:px-5 py-2 rounded-full"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-message-circle w-4 h-4"><path d="M7.9 20A9 9 0 1 0 4 16.1L2 22Z"></path></svg> FAQ</span><h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-black text-gray-900" style="font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;">Veelgestelde vragen over hotelpersoneel</h2></div></div><div class="space-y-3 sm:space-y-4"><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 0ms;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden shadow-sm"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-7 text-left"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">Hoe snel kunnen jullie hotelpersoneel leveren?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0"><p class="px-5 sm:px-7 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Bij EXTRA kunnen we in veel gevallen binnen 48 uur geschikt hotelpersoneel leveren. Dankzij onze vaste poule van geselecteerde hotelmedewerkers kunnen we snel schakelen bij uitval, piekdrukte of last-minute aanvragen. Neem contact op en we kijken direct wat mogelijk is.</p></div></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 60ms;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden shadow-sm"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-7 text-left"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">Kunnen jullie housekeeping personeel leveren?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0"><p class="px-5 sm:px-7 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Ja. Housekeeping is één van onze kernspecialisaties voor hotels. We leveren ervaren kamermeisjes en room attendants die vertrouwd zijn met hotelstandaarden en kwaliteitscontroles. Via onze favorietenpoule bouwen we een vast team op dat jouw hotel door en door kent.</p></div></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 120ms;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden shadow-sm"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-7 text-left"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">Kunnen jullie personeel leveren voor banqueting en conferenties?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0"><p class="px-5 sm:px-7 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Ja. EXTRA levert professionele bediening en keukenmedewerkers voor banqueting, conferenties en events in hotels. Van kleine boardroom-lunches tot gala-diners van 300+ gasten. We hebben ervaren medewerkers die weten hoe formele hotelservice werkt.</p></div></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 180ms;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden shadow-sm"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-7 text-left"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">Hoe werkt het met vaste teams per hotel?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0"><p class="px-5 sm:px-7 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">EXTRA werkt met favorietenpoules per opdrachtgever. We bouwen per hotel een vaste poule op van medewerkers die jouw locatie kennen. Dezelfde gezichten, minder uitleg, hogere kwaliteit. Dit geldt per afdeling: housekeeping, F&amp;B, banqueting en front office.</p></div></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 240ms;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden shadow-sm"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-7 text-left"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">Voor welke hotelfuncties kan ik personeel inhuren?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0"><p class="px-5 sm:px-7 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Via EXTRA kun je personeel inhuren voor: housekeeping, front office, F&amp;B bediening, banqueting, keuken (chefs, sous-chefs, keukenmedewerkers), afwassers en roomservice. We kijken altijd welke medewerkers het beste passen bij jouw hotel en standaard.</p></div></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 300ms;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden shadow-sm"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-7 text-left"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">Hoe wordt de kwaliteit van hotelpersoneel bewaakt?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0"><p class="px-5 sm:px-7 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Na elke dienst meten we hoe een medewerker heeft gepresteerd bij jouw hotel. Scores, complimenten en klachten worden geregistreerd. Zo weten we wie structureel goed presteert op jouw locatie en wie we prioriteit geven bij toekomstige aanvragen.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="cta" class="relative py-20 sm:py-28 lg:py-36 overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-950 via-purple-900 to-indigo-950"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none overflow-hidden "><div class="absolute" style="left: 5%; top: 10%; width: 200px; height: 200px; transform: rotate(15deg); opacity: 0.12; mask-image: url(&quot;/assets/X_patroon_1771260543289-Db4pmQup.webp&quot;); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center center; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);"></div><div class="absolute" style="left: 80%; top: 20%; width: 160px; height: 160px; transform: rotate(-25deg); opacity: 0.12; mask-image: url(&quot;/assets/X_patroon_1771260543289-Db4pmQup.webp&quot;); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center center; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);"></div><div class="absolute" style="left: 50%; top: 60%; width: 240px; height: 240px; transform: rotate(35deg);