uration-300 overflow-hidden shadow-sm"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-7 text-left"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">Heb ik ervaring nodig voor housekeeping werk?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0"><p class="px-5 sm:px-7 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Ervaring is een pluspunt, maar niet altijd vereist. We kijken vooral naar jouw motivatie, nauwkeurigheid en instelling. Voor sommige functies bieden we een korte introductie op locatie aan.</p></div></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 60ms;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden shadow-sm"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-7 text-left"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">Werk ik altijd in hetzelfde hotel?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0"><p class="px-5 sm:px-7 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">In de meeste gevallen ja. We proberen je te koppelen aan een vaste poule bij een of meerdere hotels, zodat je de werkwijze kent en je snel thuis voelt in het team.</p></div></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 120ms;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden shadow-sm"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-7 text-left"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">Kan ik zelf mijn diensten kiezen?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0"><p class="px-5 sm:px-7 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Ja. Je geeft aan wanneer je beschikbaar bent en wij zorgen voor passende diensten. Zo combineer je het werk met andere verplichtingen of activiteiten.</p></div></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 180ms;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden shadow-sm"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-7 text-left"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">Hoe werkt de betaling?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0"><p class="px-5 sm:px-7 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Na je dienst word je uitbetaald via Jixbee. Het bedrag staat doorgaans dezelfde dag nog op je rekening. Transparant en snel, zonder verrassingen.</p></div></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 240ms;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-purple-200 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden shadow-sm"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-7 text-left"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">Hoe snel kan ik beginnen met werken?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0"><p class="px-5 sm:px-7 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Na je aanmelding en een korte kennismaking kun je vaak al binnen een week je eerste diensten pakken. We zorgen dat alles snel en soepel verloopt.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-12 bg-white border-t border-purple-100/60"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8"><p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-400 mb-6 text-center">Gerelateerde pagina's</p><div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3"><a href="/housekeeping-vacatures-amsterdam" class="bg-purple-50 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full border border-purple-100 text-sm font-medium text-gray-600 hover:border-purple-400/50 hover:text-purple-700 transition-all">Housekeeping vacatures Amsterdam</a><a href="/horeca-werk" class="bg-purple-50 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full border border-purple-100 text-sm font-medium text-gray-600 hover:border-purple-400/50 hover:text-purple-700 transition-all">Horeca werk</a><a href="/chef-vacatures-amsterdam" class="bg-purple-50 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full border border-purple-100 text-sm font-medium text-gray-600 hover:border-purple-400/50 hover:text-purple-700 transition-all">Chef vacatures</a><a href="/front-offic