-gradient-to-br from-green-500 to-emerald-600 flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg z-10"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chart-column w-5 h-5 text-white"><path d="M3 3v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16"></path><path d="M18 17V9"></path><path d="M13 17V5"></path><path d="M8 17v-3"></path></svg><span class="absolute -top-1.5 -right-1.5 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-white border-2 border-purple-200 flex items-center justify-center text-[8px] font-black text-purple-700">7</span></div><div class="pb-8 sm:pb-10 flex-1"><h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-black text-gray-900 mb-1.5 leading-tight" style="font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;">Evaluatie na elke shift</h3><p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Na elke dienst wordt elke medewerker beoordeeld. De beste medewerkers blijven vanzelf over in de poule. Zo groeit de kwaliteit automatisch mee met jouw locatie.</p></div></div></div></div><div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 420ms;"><div class="relative rounded-2xl sm:rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border-2 border-orange-200 shadow-xl shadow-orange-500/10 mb-2"><div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-50 via-amber-50 to-yellow-50 p-5 sm:p-6"><div class="flex items-start gap-4"><div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-500 to-amber-500 flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-sparkles w-5 h-5 text-white"><path d="M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .963 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.581a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .964L