[10px] font-bold bg-white border border-orange-200 text-orange-700 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">✓ Extra inzet</span></div><a href="/extraatje" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-bold text-orange-700 hover:text-orange-900 mt-3 transition-colors">Meer over EXTRAATJE <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right w-3.5 h-3.5"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-12 sm:py-16" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgb(249, 247, 255) 0%, rgb(255, 255, 255) 100%);"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8"><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 0ms;"><div class="text-center mb-8 sm:mb-10"><span class="text-purple-600 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">Waarom EXTRA</span><h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-gray-900 mt-3 leading-tight" style="font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;">Wat maakt EXTRA anders?</h2></div></div><div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5 sm:gap-6"><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 0ms;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 sm:p-6 border-2 border-purple-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg hover:border-purple-200 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all h-full"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-pink-500 to-rose-500 flex items-center justify-center mb-3 shadow-md"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-heart w-5 h-5 text-white"><path d="M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-sm sm:text-base font-black text-gray-900 mb-1.5" style="font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;">Menselijk contact</h3><p class="text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Geen chatbot, maar een vast contactpersoon die jou en jouw situatie kent.</p></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 60ms;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 sm:p-6 border-2 border-purple-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg hover:border-purple-200 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all h-full"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-500 to-violet-600 flex items-center justify-center mb-3 shadow-md"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-zap w-5 h-5 text-white"><path d="M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-sm sm:text-base font-black text-gray-900 mb-1.5" style="font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;">Razendsnel schakelen</h3><p class="text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Last-minute krapte? Wij reageren snel, ook 's avonds en in het weekend.</p></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 120ms;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 sm:p-6 border-2 border-purple-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg hover:border-purple-200 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all h-full"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-500 to-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center mb-3 shadow-md"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield w-5 h-5 