t- &amp; regelgeving, inclusief ABU, Wet DBA, StiPP, NEN en identiteitscontroles. Pas daarna gaan we live.</p></div></div></div></div><div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 120ms;"><div class="relative flex gap-5 sm:gap-6"><div class="absolute left-5 top-14 bottom-0 w-0.5 bg-gradient-to-b from-purple-200 to-transparent"></div><div class="relative flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-500 to-indigo-600 flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg z-10"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-target w-5 h-5 text-white"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"></circle></svg><span class="absolute -top-1.5 -right-1.5 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-white border-2 border-purple-200 flex items-center justify-center text-[8px] font-black text-purple-700">3</span></div><div class="pb-8 sm:pb-10 flex-1"><h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-black text-gray-900 mb-1.5 leading-tight" style="font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;">Sourcing &amp; selectie op maat</h3><p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">We combineren drie bronnen: onze bestaande poule, de meest passende kandidaten via targeting en sourcing op maat wanneer nodig. Altijd de juiste match, niet de snelste.</p></div></div></div></div><div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 180ms;"><div class="relative flex gap-5 sm:gap-6"><div class="absolute left-5 top-14 bottom-0 w-0.5 bg-gradient-to-b from-purple-200 to-transparent"></div><div class="relative flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-500 to-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg z-10"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" heig